ugh voluntary liquidation process. Pursuant to the ongoing liquidation process, the liquidator of Hitech has transferred the entire business undertaking to the Company on a going concern basis on and w.e.f 04 Jun 22.      5. On Nov 04, 23, the Board approved grant of 2000 Restricted Stock Units on the recommendation of the NRC, pursuant to the Metropolis ��� Restrictive Stock Unit Plan ��� 2020 to eligible employees of the Company. This is in addition to the RSU's approved in the previous quarters.      6. Other expenses for the quarter and nine months period ended 31 Dec 23 includes Rs 418.85 lakhs on account of provision for doubtful debtors as an outcome of investigation relating to a whistle blower complaint.      7. The Board has accorded their approval for entering into a Settlement agreement with the equity shareholder(s) of Star Metropolis Health Services Middle East LLC-Dubai, associate of the Company inter-alia to enable liquidation of the Associate as per the applicable laws.      For detailed Note, kindly refer the standalone FR of the Company which are made available at www.metropolisindia.com, www.nseindia.com and www.bseindia.com.", "re_desc_note_seg": "-", "re_dil_eps_bfr_exi": null, "re_dilut_eps_for_cont_dic_opr": "5.19", "re_diluted_eps": null, "re_excepn_items": null, "re_excepn_items_new": "0", "re_extraord_items": null, "re_face_val": "2", "re_face_value_debt": null, "re_from_dt": "01-OCT-2023", "re_goi_per_shhd": null, "re_grs_npa": null, "re_grs_npa_per": null, "re_inc_dre_sttr": "0", "re_income_inv": null, "re_int_dis_adv_bills": null, "re_int_earned": null, "re_int_expd": null, "re_int_new": "524.37", "re_int_ser_cov": null, "re_minority_int": null, "re_net_profit": "2669.73", "re_net_sale": "26940.87", "re_notes_to_ac": "", "re_oper_exp": null, "re_oper_exp_bef_pro_cont": null, "re_oth": null, "re_oth_exp": "9549.27", "re_oth_inc": null, "re_oth_inc_new": "518.85", "re_oth_oper_exp": null, "re_oth_pro_cont": null, "re_oth_tot_exp": "23996.